#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:50
msgid ""
":doc:`Mattermost Embedded for M365, Teams, and Outlook </integrations-"
"guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>`"
msgstr ":doc:`OKR.BEST Embedded for M365, Teams, and Outlook </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>`"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:50
msgid ""
"Embed Mattermost in Microsoft apps. Use Outlook and Teams together with "
"Mattermost for secure backup and extra features."
msgstr "Microsoft 앱에 OKR.BEST를 임베드합니다. 안전한 백업과 추가 기능을 위해 Outlook 및 Teams를 OKR.BEST와 함께 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:53
msgid ":doc:`Microsoft Calendar </integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:53
msgid ""
"Sends your Microsoft Calendar reminders into Mattermost so you don’t miss"
" events."
msgstr "Microsoft Calendar 알림을 OKR.BEST로 보내 일정을 놓치지 않도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:55
msgid ""
":doc:`Microsoft Teams Meetings </integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-"
"meetings>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:55
msgid "Lets you start or join Microsoft Teams meetings directly from Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 직접 Microsoft Teams 회의를 시작하거나 참여할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:57
msgid ":doc:`Microsoft Teams Sync </integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-sync>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:57
msgid ""
"Copies messages from Microsoft Teams into Mattermost (one-way) to keep "
"conversations in sync."
msgstr "Microsoft Teams의 메시지를 OKR.BEST로 복사하여(단방향) 대화를 동기화 상태로 유지합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:60
msgid ""
"The following integrations bring key external tools (DevOps, ITSM, "
"monitoring, and meetings) into Mattermost, so teams can see updates, take"
" action, and collaborate faster without leaving their secure chat "
"environment."
msgstr "다음 통합은 주요 외부 도구(DevOps, ITSM, 모니터링, 회의)를 OKR.BEST로 가져와, 팀이 안전한 채팅 환경을 벗어나지 않고도 업데이트를 확인하고, 조치를 취하고, 더 빠르게 협업할 수 있게 합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:63
msgid "**Third-Party Integration**"
msgstr "**서드파티 통합**"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:65
msgid ":doc:`GitHub </integrations-guide/github>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:65
msgid ""
"Shows GitHub updates, like new pull requests, commits, or issues, in "
"Mattermost channels."
msgstr "새 풀 리퀘스트, 커밋, 이슈 같은 GitHub 업데이트를 OKR.BEST 채널에 표시합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:67
msgid ":doc:`GitLab </integrations-guide/gitlab>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:67
msgid ""
"Sends GitLab activity (code pushes, merge requests, CI/CD pipeline "
"updates) into Mattermost channels."
msgstr "GitLab 활동(코드 푸시, 병합 요청, CI/CD 파이프라인 업데이트)을 OKR.BEST 채널로 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:69
msgid ":doc:`Jira </integrations-guide/jira>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:69
msgid "Lets you see, create, and update Jira issues inside Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 내에서 Jira 이슈를 보고, 생성하고, 업데이트할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:71
msgid "`Pexip <https://mattermost.com/marketplace/pexip-video-connect/>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:71
#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:75
msgid "`Mattermost Marketplace <https://mattermost.com/marketplace/>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:71
msgid "Lets you start and join Pexip video meetings from Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 Pexip 화상 회의를 시작하고 참여할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:73
msgid ":doc:`ServiceNow </integrations-guide/servicenow>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:73
msgid ""
"Sends ServiceNow updates (like tickets or incidents) into Mattermost and "
"lets you take action from chat."
msgstr "ServiceNow 업데이트(티켓이나 인시던트 등)를 OKR.BEST로 보내고 채팅에서 조치를 취할 수 있게 합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:75
msgid "`Splunk <https://mattermost.com/marketplace/splunk-2/>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:75
msgid "Sends Splunk alerts and search results directly into Mattermost channels."
msgstr "Splunk 경고와 검색 결과를 OKR.BEST 채널로 직접 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:77
msgid ":doc:`Zoom </integrations-guide/zoom>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:77
msgid "Lets you start and join Zoom meetings from inside Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 내부에서 Zoom 회의를 시작하고 참여할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:81
msgid "More on Marketplace"
msgstr "마켓플레이스에 대한 추가 정보"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:83
msgid ""
"More integrations are available on the `Mattermost Marketplace "
"<https://mattermost.com/marketplace/>`_. You can install these "
"integrations directly from the Marketplace, by uploading them in the "
"System Console, or by using the REST API."
msgstr "더 많은 통합은 `Mattermost Marketplace <https://mattermost.com/marketplace/>`_\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다. 이러한 통합은 마켓플레이스에서 직접 설치하거나, 관리자 도구에서 업로드하거나, REST API를 사용해 설치할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:87
msgid ""
"Installed plugins are persisted to the configured file store and unpacked"
" on server startup. It's imperative that your file store be accessible to"
" the server immediately on startup. If using a shared filesystem, ensure "
"the mount completes successfully before starting the server."
msgstr "설치된 플러그인은 구성된 파일 저장소에 보존되며 서버 시작 시 압축이 해제됩니다. 시작 시 파일 저장소가 서버에서 즉시 액세스 가능해야 합니다. 공유 파일 시스템을 사용하는 경우 서버를 시작하기 전에 마운트가 성공적으로 완료되었는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/popular-integrations.rst:88
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend testing integration updates in a staging "
"environment before deploying to production, and regularly backing up "
"integrations."
msgstr "프로덕션에 배포하기 전에 스테이징 환경에서 통합 업데이트를 테스트하고, 정기적으로 통합을 백업할 것을 강력히 권장합니다."

